                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Recreational importance of the national park \"de Hoge Veluwe\". R's nationality, residence / distance from ( temporary ) residence / frequency of visiting \"de Hoge Veluwe\" and in which season / duration of stay / visited areas and facilities, recreational activities / means of transport / reason for not visiting the museum \"Kroeller-Mueller\" / attractiveness and quality of the various facilities / characteristics of nature and landscape / entry-price / whether r saw wild animals / use of \"white\" bicycles / visiting the \"visiter's centre\" / satisfaction about museum \"Kroeller-Mueller\" / frequency of visiting other museums.</p><p>Background variables: organizational membership</p>"
